modnet (ONNX, quantized)
========================

`public/models/modnet/` holds the portrait-matting network that
`/background-removal/` runs in the visitor's browser. The files are
redistributed UNMODIFIED.

- Model: MODNet — "Trimap-Free Portrait Matting in Real Time",
  https://github.com/ZHKKKe/MODNet
- Files: the ONNX conversion published as https://huggingface.co/Xenova/modnet,
  revision `fa2fa546052fba4c08921230a26cc69a333fca12`.
- License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE, the upstream file). The upstream
  README states: "The code, models, and demos in this repository (excluding
  GIF files under the folder `doc/gif`) are released under the Apache License
  2.0 license."
- Not checked: the license terms of the datasets MODNet was trained on.

