The weight file's sha256 equals the LFS sha256 the Hugging Face API reports for
that file at that revision. To re-verify:

```bash
sha256sum public/models/modnet/onnx/model_quantized.onnx
curl -sL "https://huggingface.co/api/models/Xenova/modnet/revision/fa2fa546052fba4c08921230a26cc69a333fca12?blobs=true"
```
